# Mobile-first responsive

**Authority for layout responsiveness.** UX/touch → `19-ui-ux.mdc`. CWV/PSI → `09`. Tokens → `06-tailwind.mdc`.

## 1. Core principles

| Principle | Rule |
|-----------|------|
| Mobile-first | Default styles = phone; scale up with **min-width** utilities (`sm:` / `md:` / `lg:` / `xl:`). Never desktop-first + `max-*` collapse unless an existing LCP exception (`09`). |
| Fluid layouts | No fixed layout widths like `w-[1200px]` / `width: 1200px`. Use `%`, `rem`, `vw`, `max-w-*`, Grid, Flex, and `TW_CONTAINER*`. |
| No horizontal scroll | Sections must not exceed the viewport. Prefer `max-w-full`, `min-w-0` on flex children, `box-border`. Root overflow from long Urdu titles is a bug. |

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<div className="w-[1200px] grid grid-cols-3 max-md:grid-cols-1">

// ✅ GOOD
<div className={`${TW_CONTAINER}`}>
  <div className={TW_CARD_GRID}>{/* 1 → sm:2 → lg:3 */}</div>
</div>
```

## 2. Standard breakpoints (Tailwind)

| Range | Prefix | Use |
|-------|--------|-----|
| &lt; 640px | (base) | Mobile small — **default** |
| 640–768px | `sm:` | Mobile large / tablet portrait |
| 768–1024px | `md:` | Tablet landscape; hero image may appear |
| 1024–1280px | `lg:` | Laptop; **desktop nav** (`lg:flex`); denser grids |
| &gt; 1280px | `xl:` | Large desktop — only when content needs it |

**Nav vs layout:** drawer for viewports **below `lg` (1024)**. `md` (768) is tablet layout / hero image (`09`) — not the desktop-nav switch (`19`).

## 3. Layout patterns (`TW_*`)

| Need | Pattern |
|------|---------|
| Section shell | `TW_CONTAINER` + `TW_SECTION_PY` |
| Card listing | `TW_CARD_GRID` → `1` / `sm:2` / `lg:3` |
| Two-up | `TW_GRID_2` → `1` / `sm:2` |
| Prose | `TW_CONTAINER_NARROW` (+ `lg:px-8` when needed) |
| Wide tables | `overflow-x-auto` wrapper **or** stack/cardize rows below `md` — never force full table width on phones |

## 4. Media & type

- Images / video / SVG: shrink in flow (`max-w-full` + `h-auto` when not using `fill`); Next `Image` / Sanity helpers with explicit **`sizes`** (`100vw` → `50vw` → `33vw`)
- Fluid type: theme/`rem`/`text-*` scales — bump at `sm:`/`md:` only for hierarchy; body Nastaliq leading ≥1.9 → `03-rtl-urdu.mdc`
- `viewport` (root): `device-width`, `initialScale: 1`, `viewportFit: 'cover'`
- Safe areas on drawers/sticky chrome: `env(safe-area-inset-*)` (`TW_MOBILE_PANEL*`)
- **Content parity:** same primary content on all breakpoints. `hidden md:block` only for decorative / LCP hero exceptions (`09`)

## 5. Pre-ship verification

```
[ ] 375px — layout correct, no horizontal scroll, no clipped Urdu
[ ] 768px — tablet layout / hero OK (nav still drawer below lg)
[ ] 1024px+ — desktop nav (`lg:flex`) + grids; no overflow
[ ] 1440px — desktop density OK; no overflow
[ ] Forms/buttons usable with touch (≥44px — see 19)
[ ] No text overlap at edge sizes
```

Skills: `tailwind-ui` · `rtl-check` · CWV → `optimize-lcp` / `09`.
